<div class="guide">
  <h1>Advanced bookkeeping</h1>

  <p>This guide covers the parts of the app that go beyond the bank entry screens and is an extension to the contents of the <%= link_to "user guide", easy_manual_path %>. It assumes you are comfortable with double-entry bookkeeping and also want to work directly with journal entries.</p>
  <p>One set of books is an <strong>entity</strong> &thinsp;&mdash;&thinsp; a business, a rental property, a household. Every account belongs to one, through digits 2 and 3 of its code, and that is what decides which entries may sit together.</p>

